# Changelog

## 1.2.0

- New "Potions only" and "Poisons only" checkboxes in the favorites tab and in the `/afp` window (they exclude each other).
- New "Add solvent" checkbox in the `/afp` window: includes the solvent when you link a recipe in the chat.
- New keybind (Controls > Addons) to open the `/afp` window.
- Hints about the `/afp` command in the empty list, in the favorites tab tooltip and in a one-time chat message.
- The favorites tab is now called "Favorites".
- Added an addon description and colored title and author in the addon list.

## 1.1.0

- New `/afp` command: opens a window with your favorite potions, in the same order as the alchemy station tab.
- Click a potion in the window and choose "Link in Chat" to write its recipe in the chat box.

## 1.0.0

- Initial release
